libjpeg-turbo / Independent JPEG Group
--------------------------------------
src/jpeg.rs ports libjpeg-turbo 3.2's default decompression path:
jidctint.c (jpeg_idct_islow), jdsample.c (fancy upsampling), jdcolor.c
(ycc_rgb_convert), jdmaster.c (range-limit table), jdmainct.c (context-row
edge handling), jdapimin.c (colour space defaults) and the Huffman
decoding rules of jdhuff.c/jdphuff.c, translated from C to Rust.

